      ?universityId=<uuid>  (required; defaults to user.university_id)
      ?year=YYYY
      ?month=1..12
    Returns a NIAT-styled 4-sheet workbook:
      1. Summary           — KPIs for the selected month
      2. Faculty Attendance — per-instructor row (Present / Absent /
                              Training / WFH / Leave / Sessions / Att%)
      3. Day-by-Day        — one row per date with status totals
      4. Success Coaches   — per-coach row (calls + target + attainment)
    Uses the same access rule as /api/faculty-attendance.
  - Page UI: added "⬇ Download report (.xlsx)" button next to the
    month/year selectors on the Monthly Summary tab; selecting a
    different month + year + university and clicking download
    triggers the new endpoint with those exact params.
  - No data layer migrations.
